  of the 0xe969 ABOUT case).
- 6a4a screen loop (asm 0x6a84..0x6aaf): thread the real CF via g_fist_cf (3907 + 35a7/c40a set it;
  the pristine tested a disconnected local `in_CF`) and add the cooperative INT-8 pump in the spin-wait
  -- identical reconstruction to the e714 idle loop (patch 117) and the 7088 modal loop (patch 129).
- 6acb (SETTINGS BG element paint method, asm 0x6acb..0x6aee): the __allregs vector sites dropped every
  register arg (same class as 71de/e3f8, patches 129/110) so the loader built an empty name and the
  panel resource never loaded -> RLE garbage.  Thread c560(ax=0x22 idx SETTINGS.MRL, cx=0x1c00,
  bx=0x8a96), c564(cx=0x1c00, bx=descriptor 0x8a96) and c5b0(ax=0x20, dx=word[0x8a96]) faithfully.
  (idx 0x22 = SETTINGS.MRL: MGAVIDEO name-table index 17, byte-offset 0x22; FLDCOMP=16=0x20.)
